{"a":[7,7],"h":"<p>7.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"170\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 170.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 39.0 43.4 60.0 71.2 82.4 90.7 90.7 106.4 117.0 123.7 139.4 139.4 147.0 147.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 71.2 106.4 123.7 153.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Hani bir vakıt Musâ, ehline demişti - ehliyle Medyenden çıkmış giderken Tuva vadîsinde soğuk ve karanlık bir gecede yolu şaşırmış, çakmak çakmış taşı çakmamış, böyle her vasıtanın kesildiği tam bir naçarlık deminde Tur canibinden kendine bir ateş zuhur etmiş idi, o vakıt demişti ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 31.6 38.3 54.0 54.0 70.6 82.6 89.3 89.3 96.0 105.0 105.0 116.3 116.3 116.3 123.0 123.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 70.6 82.6 129.8\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ben cidden bir ateş hissettim</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"376\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 376.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 24.0 24.0 30.7 37.6 54.0 71.3 78.0 93.7 93.7 110.3 117.0 125.3 125.3 137.3 137.3 153.0 153.0 162.0 162.0 174.0 180.7 180.7 187.6 187.6 203.3 203.3 211.6 227.3 227.3 234.7 241.6 254.3 254.3 270.0 276.7 285.0 285.0 291.7 291.7 307.6 307.6 316.6 316.6 328.6 335.3 335.3 342.0 342.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\">